"text","value":"你可以在","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":751},"end":{"line":25,"column":5,"offset":755}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"/zh-HK/courses/create-your-sdk-with-codama/updating-codama-idl","children":[{"type":"text","value":"更新 Codama IDL","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":6,"offset":756},"end":{"line":25,"column":19,"offset":769}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":5,"offset":755},"end":{"line":25,"column":84,"offset":834}}},{"type":"text","value":"課程中了解更多有關如何使用訪問者來自定義和增強轉換後的 IDL 的內容。","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":84,"offset":834},"end":{"line":25,"column":120,"offset":870}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":751},"end":{"line":25,"column":120,"offset":870}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":25,"column":120,"offset":870}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 從 Anchor IDL 建立你的 Codama IDL\r\n\r\n從 Anchor 建立 Codama IDL 非常簡單。當你使用 anchor build 生成 Anchor IDL 後，我們需要安裝 '@codama/nodes-from-anchor' 套件：\r\n\r\n```\r\npnpm install codama @codama/nodes-from-anchor\r\n```\r\n\r\n然後直接使用 `rootNodeFromAnchor ` 函數轉換 Anchor IDL：\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nimport { createFromRoot } from 'codama';\r\nimport { rootNodeFromAnchor } from '@codama/nodes-from-anchor';\r\nimport anchorIdl from 'anchor-idl.json';\r\n\r\nconst codama = createFromRoot(rootNodeFromAnchor(anchorIdl));\r\n```\r\n\r\n這樣你就可以獲得一個完全可用的 Codama IDL，準備好用於客戶端生成。然而，Codama 的真正強大之處在於它能夠增強和自定義你的 IDL，超越原始 Anchor 定義的可能性。\r\n\r\n由於轉換過程專注於結構翻譯，你通常會希望添加對開發者友好的功能，例如自定義命名規範、額外的類型信息或專門的客戶端方法。Codama 的訪問者系統使這些增強功能變得簡單而強大。\r\n\r\n你可以在[更新 Codama IDL](/zh-HK/courses/create-your-sdk-with-codama/updating-codama-idl)課程中了解更多有關如何使用訪問者來自定義和增強轉換後的 IDL 的內容。","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"text","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[